            {
              "id": "1780088031397_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Provide your output in the language {{$context.$nodes.GET_USER_SESSION_INFORMATION.$output.items[0].Language}}.\n\nSummarize the order status and line descriptions in less than 40 words in complete sentences from the order details from {{$context.$nodes.CLEAN_PURCHASE_ORDER_DETAILS.$output.result}}.\nDon't say how many lines there are, don't include the POHeaderId in the response, and don't present the order status in all capital letters. Use natural language for the item descriptions, if possible.\n\nIf StatusCode = PENDING APPROVAL, add a sentence to your response mentioning who the current approver of the order is using the following data:\nApprover Name: {{$context.$nodes.GET_CURRENT_APPROVER.$output.items[0].ApproverName}}\nIf there was no data provided, do not mention this at all.\n\nIf StatusCode = REJECTED, add a sentence to your response mentioning who rejected the order and why using the following data:\nRejected By: {{$context.$nodes.GET_PURCHASE_ORDER_EXCEPTIONS.$output.items[0].RejectedBy}}\nReason: {{$context.$nodes.GET_PURCHASE_ORDER_EXCEPTIONS.$output.items[0].Reason}}\nIf there was no data provided, do not mention this at all.\n\nFinally, I will give you the value of two variables. One will have a value and one will be null. Whichever one has a value, append that to the end of the message on its own line without any modifications:\n{{$context.$nodes.VIEW_PURCHASE_ORDER_DEEPLINK.$output}}\n{{$context.$nodes.EDIT_PURCHASE_ORDER_DEEPLINK.$output}}"
            }
          ],
